                <invention-title lang="de">KIPPHEBELANORDNUNG FÜR MOTORBREMSE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">ENSEMBLE CULBUTEUR POUR FREINAGE MOTEUR</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ROCKER ARM ASSEMBLY FOR ENGINE BRAKING</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An exhaust valve rocker arm assembly selectively opening first and second exhaust valves. The assembly comprises an exhaust rocker arm; a valve bridge operably associated with the exhaust rocker arm and including a main body and a lever rotatably coupled to the main body, the main body configured to engage the first exhaust valve, and the lever configured to engage the second exhaust valve; and an engine brake rocker arm having an engine brake capsule movable between a retracted position where the engine brake capsule is configured to not engage the lever, and an extended position where the engine brake capsule is configured to engage the lever to thereby engage the second exhaust valve.</p>
            </abstract>
